*name C09NAT
*call yesmemory
*perso:602300
*no list
*forex
c---- C9 native probe: character comparison.
      PROGRAM C09NAT
      CHARACTER*6 S,T
      S='ABCD'
      T='ABCE'
      IF (S .EQ. T) GO TO 10
      PRINT 11
   10 PRINT 12
   11 FORMAT(1X,'NE')
   12 FORMAT(1X,'EQ')
      STOP
      END
*execute
*end file
